Can we take a photo to

287
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,720
commemorate your first day

288
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:17,960
back home as my boyfriend?

289
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:25,320
One, two, three.

290
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,800
Why did you make that face?

291
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:33,080
Was it not okay?

292
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:35,480
It's okay.

293
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,720
I want you to do more.

294
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:40,800
Wait a minute!

295
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:42,360
We just got back,

296
00:21:42,360 --> 00:21:43,840
and we have so much work to do.

297
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,040
Mmm!

298
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,240
The picture is cute.

299
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:56,960
Yes, very cute.

300
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:03,720
What are you doing?

301
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:05,360
- I'll post it.
- Huh?

302
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:07,520
Hey, don't do that.

303
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:09,080
Other people will see.

304
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:10,000
I want them to see.

305
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:13,200
(I have a boyfriend now)

306
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,760
It's done. I tagged you too.

307
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:18,440
And what caption did you write?

308
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:20,760
See for yourself.

309
00:22:21,080 --> 00:22:22,120
Hey!

310
00:22:30,280 --> 00:22:33,480
(I have a boyfriend now)

311
00:23:00,560 --> 00:23:02,240
What are you doing, Mr. boyfriend?

312
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:03,960
Finding something to eat.

313
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,280
But there's nothing to eat.

314
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:10,160
Then let’s go

315
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,640
buy some groceries for the house.

316
00:23:20,520 --> 00:23:21,480
Hello, Mama Wan.

317
00:23:25,360 --> 00:23:26,440
Yes.

318
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:32,080
Mama Wan saw your Instagram post,

319
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:33,880
so she called me over.

320
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,440
I'll go too.

321
00:23:36,600 --> 00:23:38,080
I have something to tell her, too.

322
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,760
Nont, wait.

323
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:05,360
No need to take it off anymore.

324
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:15,800
I won't take it off anymore.

325
00:24:32,520 --> 00:24:33,880
You came too, Kit?

326
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:36,720
I thought Nont would come alone.

327
00:24:38,880 --> 00:24:40,840
I have something I’d like to talk to you.

328
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:44,920
Take a seat first.

329
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:59,000
What is it that you wanted

330
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:00,000
to talk to me about?

331
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:02,280
You saw the picture of me and Nont, right?

332
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,880
I like men.

333
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:09,600
I love Nont.

334
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:11,480
I already know.

335
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:14,760
You know...

336
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:19,920
And I've known for a long time, too.

337
00:25:22,320 --> 00:25:23,920
Even before you realized it yourself.

338
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:26,440
Who told you?

339
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:29,000
No one had to tell me.

340
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:32,560
I’ve been your mother for 27 years, Kit.

341
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:34,440
Why wouldn’t I know?

342
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:37,800
But ‘knowing’

343
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:39,520
and ‘hearing it said’

344
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:42,760
feel very different.

345
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:46,280
I'm is glad that today you came

346
00:25:46,280 --> 00:25:47,960
and told me the truth, Kit.

347
00:25:50,280 --> 00:25:51,400
But I’m also not at ease...

348
00:25:52,040 --> 00:25:53,840
I know you wouldn’t be at ease.

349
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:57,640
But I’ve thought it through carefully.

350
00:25:58,040 --> 00:25:59,560
I'm not worried about you, Kit.

351
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,440
I'm worried about Nont.

352
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:06,760
I know how Nont feels about Kit,

353
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,880
and how long he’s been waiting.

354
00:26:09,840 --> 00:26:10,960
You knew,

355
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:12,520
Mama Wan?

356
00:26:13,320 --> 00:26:15,040
I’m not only Kit’s mother.

357
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:18,040
I’ve been your mother for 10 years too.

358
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:21,200
But I had to pretend not to know,

359
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:24,080
and not tell Kit how you felt about him.

360
00:26:25,800 --> 00:26:29,000
This kind of thing wasn’t mine to tell.

361
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:35,480
And about the marriage,

362
00:26:36,600 --> 00:26:38,240
were you planning to help me?

363
00:26:39,600 --> 00:26:40,800
I just knew that

364
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:43,080
you were willing to protect Kit.

365
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:47,040
As for whether anything else would follow,

366
00:26:47,560 --> 00:26:48,840
that was for the two of you

367
00:26:48,840 --> 00:26:49,840
to learn together.

368
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:06,200
The thing you’re worried about with Nont,

369
00:27:07,560 --> 00:27:08,560
what is it?

370
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,560
Kit, how long did it take you

371
00:27:10,560 --> 00:27:12,040
to learn about yourself?

372
00:27:13,560 --> 00:27:14,920
Nont took just as long

373
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:16,440
waiting for you, Kit.

374
00:27:20,520 --> 00:27:21,600
Yes.

375
00:27:22,080 --> 00:27:24,040
Nont waited for me for a very long time.

376
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,360
Yes, my child.

377
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:28,240
Nont waited for you for a very long time.

378
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:32,880
And the reason I called Nont here today

379
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:34,280
it’s because I have something

380
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:35,400
I'd like to ask.

381
00:27:36,120 --> 00:27:37,160
Yes?

382
00:27:37,520 --> 00:27:39,080
I'd like you to continue your studies

383
00:27:39,080 --> 00:27:40,360
for two or three more years.

384
00:27:44,520 --> 00:27:46,840
Why are you telling my partner to leave me?

385
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:51,080
I want Nont to go live life

386
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:52,520
the way he wants to.

387
00:27:53,160 --> 00:27:55,360
Not just live waiting for someone.

388
00:27:57,520 --> 00:27:59,080
And it’ll be the same for you, Kit,

389
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:02,000
you’ll learn what it’s like

390
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:03,080
to wait for someone,

391
00:28:03,080 --> 00:28:04,840
just like Nont once waited for you.

392
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:08,920
If Nont goes and lives his own life

393
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,640
and comes back

394
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:13,200
and his feelings are still the same...

395
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:18,680
I have no objection to the two of you

396
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,680
being together.

397
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,480
Mama Wan.

398
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:56,240
I...

399
00:28:57,600 --> 00:28:58,920
would like to think about it first.

400
00:29:04,080 --> 00:29:05,320
That is exactly the answer

401
00:29:05,320 --> 00:29:06,400
I was looking for.

402
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:16,040
Was it okay talking to Mama Wan?

403
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,160
It was okay,

404
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,320
more than okay actually.

405
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:20,960
Once I said it out loud,

406
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,000
I felt so much lighter.

407
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:25,040
And you, will you go?

408
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:28,200
Mmm.

409
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:32,040
I haven't figured it out yet.

410
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,560
Forget about it first.

411
00:29:37,960 --> 00:29:39,120
I'm so hungry now.

412
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:42,880
Then let’s go buy groceries

413
00:29:42,880 --> 00:29:43,920
and cook at home.

414
00:29:44,080 --> 00:29:45,960
- Let's go.
- I’ll serve you dessert

415
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,360
so you won’t want to

416
00:29:47,360 --> 00:29:48,520
go anywhere far from me.

417
00:29:49,080 --> 00:29:50,160
What dessert?

418
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:51,480
You'll find out.

419
00:29:51,480 --> 00:29:52,400
Hey!

420
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:16,400
Mmm! Delicious!

421
00:30:24,760 --> 00:30:25,920
Mmm!

422
00:30:43,320 --> 00:30:44,880
So have you gotten an answer yet

423
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:46,400
about continuing your studies?

424
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:52,640
How do you want me to decide?

425
00:30:55,040 --> 00:30:57,000
If you ask me, I don’t want you to go.

426
00:30:57,760 --> 00:30:59,240
But if you really have to go,

427
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:00,440
I’ll wait.

428
00:31:06,080 --> 00:31:07,440
Why are you making that face?

429
00:31:16,320 --> 00:31:17,320
You know what?

430
00:31:18,320 --> 00:31:19,760
This is exactly what makes me

431
00:31:19,760 --> 00:31:20,960
afraid to decide.

432
00:31:24,800 --> 00:31:25,920
I know you well.

433
00:31:27,080 --> 00:31:28,920
You’re not someone who waits for anyone.

434
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:32,080
Then you’ll have to get to know a new me

435
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,640
because this version of me

436
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:35,720
can wait for you.

437
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:51,720
Hey! Kit!

438
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:57,200
It’s all over me now!

439
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:02,800
Why are you eating so messily?

440
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:45,160
Do you like cold things?

441
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,400
It’s cold.

442
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,120
I know.

443
00:33:58,720 --> 00:33:59,880
Do you like it?

444
00:34:10,480 --> 00:34:11,760
What am I writing?

445
00:34:12,200 --> 00:34:13,200
L.

446
00:34:18,200 --> 00:34:19,240
O.

447
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:24,920
V.

448
00:34:31,920 --> 00:34:32,840
E.

449
00:34:38,320 --> 00:34:39,480
I love you.

450
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:41,920
Come in.

451
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:47,760
Boss,

452
00:35:47,760 --> 00:35:49,000
a reporter from Business Today

453
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,600
is requesting another interview.

454
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:52,440
Sure.

455
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,760
Then I’ll tell them

456
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:55,440
we’d like to see the questions first.

457
00:35:55,720 --> 00:35:57,760
It’s fine. I can answer any question.

458
00:35:58,400 --> 00:35:59,440
Are you sure?

459
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,760
I have nothing to hide.

460
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:03,800
Well then...

461
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:04,720
Do your best, Boss.

462
00:36:12,640 --> 00:36:13,880
Mr. Kit,

463
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:16,200
NSL is expanding overseas.

464
00:36:16,640 --> 00:36:19,120
Since you made your personal life public,

465
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:21,320
has it had any impact on the business?

466
00:36:21,520 --> 00:36:22,440
Yes.

467
00:36:22,720 --> 00:36:24,400
Some investors have requested additional

468
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:25,880
meetings to assess the situation.

469
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:27,360
But NSL's work remains the same,

470
00:36:27,360 --> 00:36:28,840
and our quality hasn't changed.

471
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:31,440
Do your business partners still have

472
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:32,640
confidence in you?

473
00:36:33,120 --> 00:36:34,520
The people who work with me

474
00:36:34,520 --> 00:36:36,360
believe in what my company has built.

475
00:36:36,680 --> 00:36:37,960
When it comes to business,

476
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:39,840
I want NSL to be able to stand on its own,

477
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:41,120
without having to rely on me

478
00:36:41,120 --> 00:36:42,120
being there all the time.

479
00:36:42,120 --> 00:36:44,120
What were you trying to convey

480
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:46,000
when you posted about it on Instagram?

481
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:47,800
I wanted to speak for myself before

482
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,560
someone else spoke on my behalf.

483
00:36:49,560 --> 00:36:51,400
Why did you choose to speak out now?

484
00:36:52,080 --> 00:36:53,400
Because I'm ready now.

485
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,400
Before this, I wasn't ready.

486
00:36:57,240 --> 00:36:58,600
It wasn't because I was afraid

487
00:36:58,600 --> 00:37:00,080
of what other people might think,

488
00:37:00,080 --> 00:37:01,240
but because I hadn't been

489
00:37:01,240 --> 00:37:02,200
honest enough with myself.

490
00:37:02,200 --> 00:37:04,840
And Mr. Nontawat, the person in that post,

491
00:37:05,240 --> 00:37:06,720
who is he to you?

492
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:10,760
He's the person I love.

493
00:37:11,720 --> 00:37:12,920
Is that all?

494
00:37:13,200 --> 00:37:14,240
That's all.

495
00:37:14,680 --> 00:37:16,440
Business can be complicated.

496
00:37:18,080 --> 00:37:19,640
But loving Nont

497
00:37:19,840 --> 00:37:21,280
doesn't have to be.

498
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:37,960
Why did you choose to speak out now?

499
00:37:38,240 --> 00:37:39,640
Because I'm ready now.

500
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,600
Before this, I wasn't ready.

501
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:44,800
It wasn't because I was afraid

502
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:46,280
of what other people might think,

503
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,440
but because I hadn't been

504
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:48,400
honest enough with myself.

505
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,560
And Mr. Nontawat,

506
00:37:49,560 --> 00:37:51,280
the person in that post...

507
00:37:51,600 --> 00:37:52,800
He's the person I love.

508
00:37:53,600 --> 00:37:54,600
Is that all?

509
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:56,080
That's all.

510
00:37:56,520 --> 00:37:58,400
Business can be complicated.

511
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:01,280
But loving Nont

512
00:38:01,720 --> 00:38:03,200
doesn't have to be.

513
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:16,760
Kit, I'd like to meet with you privately.

514
00:38:35,120 --> 00:38:36,240
Have a seat.

515
00:38:43,720 --> 00:38:45,760
Thank you for agreeing to meet with me.

516
00:38:50,440 --> 00:38:52,080
I watched your interview.

517
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,200
First of all,

518
00:38:55,200 --> 00:38:56,640
congratulations

519
00:38:57,520 --> 00:38:58,520
on finding love.

520
00:38:59,600 --> 00:39:00,640
Thank you.

521
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,800
I wanted to tell you that...

522
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:05,960
I'm giving up.

523
00:39:08,240 --> 00:39:10,040
I admit that

524
00:39:11,040 --> 00:39:12,080
I've still had feelings

525
00:39:12,080 --> 00:39:13,320
for you all this time.

526
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:15,440
And I used to tell myself that

527
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:18,400
merging our companies

528
00:39:20,160 --> 00:39:21,360
would give me a chance

529
00:39:21,360 --> 00:39:22,360
to get closer to you

530
00:39:24,080 --> 00:39:25,320
and win your heart.

531
00:39:28,080 --> 00:39:29,760
But now I realize I was wrong.

532
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:36,000
I'm sorry.

533
00:39:36,640 --> 00:39:38,160
You don't have to apologize.

534
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:42,680
Men like us have to go through

535
00:39:42,680 --> 00:39:44,080
a lot of soul-searching

536
00:39:44,080 --> 00:39:45,440
and struggle to come to terms

537
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:46,640
with our own feelings

538
00:39:48,080 --> 00:39:49,640
before we can find the courage

539
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:50,480
to love someone.

540
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:52,200
But you've already found that clarity

541
00:39:53,120 --> 00:39:54,520
and have the courage to love.

542
00:39:55,960 --> 00:39:57,040
I respect you for that.

543
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:09,240
Our personal matters are settled now.

544
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:13,280
Let's talk business.

545
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:17,480
I may have lost the battle for your heart,

546
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,680
but when it comes to business

547
00:40:18,680 --> 00:40:19,760
I'm still in the game,

548
00:40:19,760 --> 00:40:21,160
and I'm not backing down.

549
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:23,760
You know I love competition,

550
00:40:24,800 --> 00:40:25,960
and I believe

551
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:28,560
I'm entitled to a piece of NSL.

552
00:40:32,240 --> 00:40:33,520
Mr. Pat has been trying to

553
00:40:33,520 --> 00:40:34,840
get in touch with me for a while.

554
00:40:36,560 --> 00:40:38,080
He wants to reduce your control

555
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:41,400
and become a major shareholder.

556
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:42,920
As for me...

557
00:40:44,640 --> 00:40:46,440
I want your position as CEO.

558
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:49,040
I understand.

559
00:40:51,120 --> 00:40:52,240
But why are you telling me

560
00:40:52,240 --> 00:40:53,240
this beforehand?

561
00:40:53,240 --> 00:40:54,360
So you'll know I'm not

562
00:40:54,360 --> 00:40:55,440
going behind your back.

563
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:56,720
Even if we're nothing more

564
00:40:56,720 --> 00:40:58,120
than business partners now,

565
00:40:58,560 --> 00:40:59,600
I still want a partner

566
00:40:59,600 --> 00:41:00,800
who's ambitious enough

567
00:41:01,080 --> 00:41:02,280
to grow the company.

568
00:41:02,760 --> 00:41:03,800
Grow the company?

569
00:41:04,720 --> 00:41:06,520
But I'm still willing to give you a chance.

570
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:09,120
You have to raise more capital.

571
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:11,240
If you can't,

572
00:41:12,080 --> 00:41:13,200
you'll have to step aside.

573
00:41:14,480 --> 00:41:15,720
How much time do I have left?

574
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,120
One month.

575
00:41:22,600 --> 00:41:23,720
See you around.

576
00:41:37,560 --> 00:41:38,720
Can I ask you something?

577
00:41:38,720 --> 00:41:39,880
Of course.

578
00:41:39,880 --> 00:41:41,360
Let's say there's someone

579
