587
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:56,760
They're happy, but somehow,

588
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:58,320
they can't fully enjoy that happiness.

589
00:41:58,320 --> 00:41:59,960
It's a feeling they can't quite explain.

590
00:42:00,800 --> 00:42:01,960
What is it?

591
00:42:02,800 --> 00:42:05,040
It's perfectly normal to feel that way.

592
00:42:05,640 --> 00:42:08,160
Because having your love returned

593
00:42:08,720 --> 00:42:09,920
isn't necessarily

594
00:42:09,920 --> 00:42:11,040
