595
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:12,400
that people often imagine.

596
00:42:13,160 --> 00:42:14,160
It's actually

597
00:42:14,160 --> 00:42:16,120
the beginning of something even harder.

598
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:20,800
The beginning of something even harder?

599
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,440
Yes.

600
00:42:22,520 --> 00:42:24,040
Before, all you had to do was wait.

601
00:42:24,640 --> 00:42:26,040
But once your wish comes true,

602
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:28,160
you have to maintain the relationship.

603
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:29,920
And that's much harder.

604
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:32,480
Waiting only requires hope.

605
00:42:33,280 --> 00:42:34,600
But maintaining a relationship

606
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:37,520
requires understanding, patience,

607
00:42:38,280 --> 00:42:39,640
and genuine adjustment.

608
00:42:40,720 --> 00:42:42,000
But they've been together

609
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:43,040
for 10 years already.

610
00:42:44,840 --> 00:42:46,320
Shouldn't adjusting to each other

611
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,400
be easy by now?

612
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:49,160
Being someone's secret admirer

613
00:42:49,160 --> 00:42:50,840
and being their partner

614
00:42:51,760 --> 00:42:53,000
are two very different things.

615
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:55,040
For 10 years,

616
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:58,000
