617
00:42:58,000 --> 00:42:59,400
has always been the one giving.

618
00:42:59,760 --> 00:43:01,200
So when someone finally starts

619
00:43:01,200 --> 00:43:02,560
taking care of them in return,

620
00:43:02,560 --> 00:43:03,720
they might feel strange and

621
00:43:03,720 --> 00:43:05,600
uncomfortable without even realizing it.

622
00:43:07,120 --> 00:43:08,160
I went for a run and

623
