643
00:44:24,520 --> 00:44:25,640
I do.

644
00:44:26,680 --> 00:44:27,880
I'm just not used to this yet.

645
00:44:28,760 --> 00:44:29,800
You'll get used to it.

646
00:44:32,520 --> 00:44:33,760
For the person who's only

647
00:44:33,760 --> 00:44:34,880
just begun to love,

648
00:44:34,880 --> 00:44:37,800
this relationship is just beginning.

649
00:44:38,520 --> 00:44:40,360
But for the person who's waited so long,

650
00:44:41,000 --> 00:44:42,040
