will have to go through

666
00:45:17,400 --> 00:45:18,840
a new journey of self-discovery.

667
00:45:18,840 --> 00:45:20,680
Everything will be new to them.

668
00:45:21,880 --> 00:45:23,160
The important question is

669
00:45:23,640 --> 00:45:25,320
Can the person who's waited 10 years

670
00:45:25,600 --> 00:45:26,720
