674
00:46:38,840 --> 00:46:40,000
Mama Wan.

675
00:46:41,480 --> 00:46:42,600
I will continue my study.

676
00:46:51,400 --> 00:46:52,800
Focus on your studies, okay?

677
00:46:53,040 --> 00:46:54,040
When you come back,

678
